WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.506
Last stretch: ship the parts, and send the invoice.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.502
Open Dispatch.

00:00:07.550 --> 00:00:10.178
Your order shows Ready. Hit Dispatch order.

00:00:10.778 --> 00:00:13.476
Done. The dispatch note is right there to print.

00:00:13.928 --> 00:00:17.799
Now the invoice. Open Finance, then Customer invoices.

00:00:18.399 --> 00:00:21.431
Scroll to your project, and hit Create invoice.

00:00:22.031 --> 00:00:25.878
There's the invoice number. When the money arrives, hit Mark paid.

00:00:27.828 --> 00:00:31.138
From order to paid invoice, all in one place.

